        <GeometryDrawing Geometry="M13.31,6.58 L15.21,6.86 L15.21,9.14 L13.31,9.42 L12.76,10.75 L13.91,12.29 L12.29,13.91 L10.75,12.76 L9.42,13.31 L9.14,15.21 L6.86,15.21 L6.58,13.31 L5.25,12.76 L3.71,13.91 L2.09,12.29 L3.24,10.75 L2.69,9.42 L0.79,9.14 L0.79,6.86 L2.69,6.58 L3.24,5.25 L2.09,3.71 L3.71,2.09 L5.25,3.24 L6.58,2.69 L6.86,0.79 L9.14,0.79 L9.42,2.69 L10.75,3.24 L12.29,2.09 L13.91,3.71 L12.76,5.25 Z M5.7,8 A2.3,2.3 0 1 1 10.3,8 A2.3,2.3 0 1 1 5.7,8 Z">
